OL,3,APassengers sleep on floors and describe
OL,4,Aairport 'carnage' as hundreds more
OL,5,Aflights cancelled
OL,6,
OL,7,FImages show passengers sleeping on
OL,8,Fairport floors as almost 300 more
OL,9,Fflights are cancelled after yesterday's
OL,10,Ftechnical problem at air traffic
OL,11,Fcontrol
OL,13,FSome 1,750 flights were cancelled on
OL,14,FTuesday, according to aviation
OL,15,Fanalytics firm Cirium, with hundreds of
OL,16,Fthousands of passengers affected by the
OL,17,Fchaos
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
