OL,3,AMiliband says UK had to 'call out'
OL,4,AIsraeli West Bank settlements
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, Miliband told Parliament
OL,7,Fthe UK would ban the import of goods
OL,8,Ffrom Israeli settlements in the
OL,9,Fillegally occupied West Bank
OL,11,FMiliband also said "settler terrorists"
OL,12,Fwere carrying out "ethnic cleansing" -
OL,13,Faccusing the Israeli government of
OL,14,Fturning a "blind eye"
OL,16,FWithin hours, Israel responded with
OL,17,Ffour "counter-measures" against the UK
OL,18,F- including the closure of the UK
OL,19,Fconsulate in Jerusalem, which is
OL,20,Fexpected to shut in the next 30 days
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
