OL,3,ADrug gangs exploited and raped us as
OL,4,Ateens, then police failed us, women
OL,5,Atell BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: Contains details of sexual
OL,8,Fexploitation
OL,10,F"It was the thrill of being with a bad
OL,11,Fboy."
OL,13,FChristine was 13 when she began
OL,14,Fexchanging messages online with someone
OL,15,Fshe believed was a teenage boy.
OL,17,FOn their first meeting, she discovered
OL,18,Fhe was a grown man 10 years older than
OL,19,Fherself. He also told her he was
OL,20,Finvolved with gangs and drugs.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
