OL,3,APrince William joins other royalty at
OL,4,Afuneral of Norway's King Harald V as
OL,5,Acrowds line streets
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, a funeral procession took the
OL,8,Fking's casket from the Royal Palace to
OL,9,Fthe Oslo Cathedral - he will then be
OL,10,Flaid to rest at Akershus Fortress
OL,12,FPrince William is representing King
OL,13,FCharles while Princess Anne - godmother
OL,14,Fto the new Norwegian king - is in
OL,15,Fattendance but in a private capacity
OL,17,FAs well as European royalty,
OL,18,Finternational figures such as King
OL,19,FAbdullah II of Jordan and Ukraine's
OL,20,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky are at the
OL,21,Ffuneral
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
